---
layout: layout.njk
permalink: /timeline/
title: Timeline
description: Every dated thing I’ve built, by the year it started, newest first.
---
<section class="intro">
  <h1>Timeline</h1>
  <p class="lede">Every dated thing I’ve built, by the year it started, newest first. The bar under each year counts what was alive then. Each thing’s strip runs from {{ site.timeline.firstYear }} to {{ site.timeline.lastYear }}: the bar is how long it lived, the dots are the events I have a source for. The bars are my decisions. The dots are evidence.</p>
  <p class="legend">
    {% for s in site.statuses %}<span class="status status-{{ s.status }}">{{ s.label }}</span> {% endfor %}
  </p>
</section>
<ol class="tl-years">
  {% for y in site.timeline.years %}
  <li class="tl-year{% if not y.started.length %} is-quiet{% endif %}" id="y{{ y.year }}">
    <h2 class="tl-year-label">{{ y.year }}</h2>
    <div class="tl-year-body">
      <div class="tl-alive">
        {{ y | aliveBar(site.timeline) | safe }}
        <span class="muted">{{ y.total }} alive{% if y.started.length %} · {{ y.started.length }} new{% endif %}{% if y.events %} · <a href="/history/#{{ y.year }}">{{ y.events }} {{ 'event' if y.events == 1 else 'events' }}</a>{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      {% if y.started.length %}
      <ul class="tl-things">
        {% for row in y.started %}
        <li>
          {{ row | lifespan(site.timeline) | safe }}
          <div class="tl-thing">
          <a class="thing-title" href="{{ row.thing.page }}">{{ row.thing.title }}</a>
          <span class="status status-{{ row.thing.status }}" title="{{ row.thing.statusDescription }}">{{ row.thing.statusLabel }}</span>
          <span class="dates">
            {%- if row.thing.started %}{{ row.thing.started | date }}{% else %}{{ row.start }}{% endif %}
            {%- if row.thing.ended %} – {{ row.thing.ended | date }}{% elif row.thing.status == 'active' or row.thing.status == 'dormant' %} – now{% elif row.end != row.start %} – {{ row.end }}{% endif -%}
          </span>
          </div>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      {% endif %}
      {% if y.ended.length %}
      <p class="tl-ended muted">Ended: {% for row in y.ended %}<a href="{{ row.thing.page }}">{{ row.thing.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>
{% if site.timeline.undated | length %}
<section class="undated">
  <h2>Not yet dated</h2>
  <p class="muted">I haven’t found a sourced start date or event for these yet.</p>
  <p>{% for thing in site.timeline.undated %}<a class="tag" href="{{ thing.page }}">{{ thing.title }}</a> {% endfor %}</p>
</section>
{% endif %}
